# Everything is text, stored and checked out as LF.
#
# Without this, Windows checks these files out with CRLF while the
# repository holds LF, and `git status` reports files as modified that
# have no change in them. Worse for this project: tools/mkpages.pl builds
# docs/index.html by concatenating tools/head.html (no terminator) onto
# index.html (CRLF), so the published page came out with mixed endings
# depending on which machine last ran the build.
* text=auto eol=lf
